# **/.agents/skills/personal-*


# ============================================================
# IMPORTANT
# ============================================================

# DO NOT add:
# lib/
#
# Flutter projects use lib/ for actual application source code.
# Your Python projects can have lib/ too; it must not be
# globally ignored in this mixed repository.